{"scene_id": "pt_enemy_6", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/pdtrain/scenes/pt_enemy_6.fountain", "heading": "INT. ENEMY - CONTINUOUS", "cast": [{"id": 0, "name": "DOCTOR", "names": ["DOCTOR"], "gender": "?", "first": 38, "spoke": 0}, {"id": 1, "name": "STOCKMANN", "names": ["STOCKMANN"], "gender": "m", "first": 3, "spoke": 0}], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "INT. ENEMY - CONTINUOUS", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad (getting up).", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "All the conduit-pipes\u2014?", "para": 0, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": [1]}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, of course.", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": [1]}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "The intake is too low down; it will have to be lifted to a position much higher up.", "para": 1, "sent": 2, "present": [1]}, {"u": 6, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra.", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": [1]}, {"u": 7, "kind": "action", "text": "Then you were right after all.", "para": 2, "sent": 1, "present": [1]}, {"u": 8, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": [1]}, {"u": 9, "kind": "action", "text": "Ah, you remember, Petra\u2014I wrote opposing the plans before the work was begun.", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": [1]}, {"u": 10, "kind": "action", "text": "But at that time no one would listen to me.", "para": 3, "sent": 2, "present": [1]}, {"u": 11, "kind": "action", "text": "Well, I am going to let them have it now.", "para": 3, "sent": 3, "present": [1]}, {"u": 12, "kind": "action", "text": "Of course I have prepared a report for the Baths Committee; I have had it ready for a week, and was only waiting for this to come.", "para": 3, "sent": 4, "present": [1]}, {"u": 13, "kind": "action", "text": "(Shows the letter.)", "para": 3, "sent": 5, "present": [1]}, {"u": 14, "kind": "action", "text": "Now it shall go off at once.", "para": 3, "sent": 6, "present": [1]}, {"u": 15, "kind": "action", "text": "(Goes into his room and comes back with some papers.)", "para": 3, "sent": 7, "present": [1]}, {"u": 16, "kind": "action", "text": "Look at that!", "para": 3, "sent": 8, "present": [1]}, {"u": 17, "kind": "action", "text": "Four closely written sheets!\u2014and the letter shall go with them.", "para": 3, "sent": 9, "present": [1]}, {"u": 18, "kind": "action", "text": "Give me a bit of paper, Katherine\u2014something to wrap them up in.", "para": 3, "sent": 10, "present": [1]}, {"u": 19, "kind": "action", "text": "That will do!", "para": 3, "sent": 11, "present": [1]}, {"u": 20, "kind": "action", "text": "Now give it to-to-(stamps his foot)\u2014what the deuce is her name?\u2014give it to the maid, and tell her to take it at once to the Mayor.", "para": 3, "sent": 12, "present": [1]}, {"u": 21, "kind": "action", "text": "(Mrs. Stockmann takes the packet and goes out through the dining-room.)", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": [1]}, {"u": 22, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": [1]}, {"u": 23, "kind": "action", "text": "What do you think Uncle Peter will say, father?", "para": 5, "sent": 1, "present": [1]}, {"u": 24, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": [1]}, {"u": 25, "kind": "action", "text": "What is there for him to say?", "para": 6, "sent": 1, "present": [1]}, {"u": 26, "kind": "action", "text": "I should think he would be very glad that such an important truth has been brought to light.", "para": 6, "sent": 2, "present": [1]}, {"u": 27, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 7, "sent": 0, "present": [1]}, {"u": 28, "kind": "action", "text": "Will you let me print a short note about your discovery in the \"Messenger?\"", "para": 7, "sent": 1, "present": [1]}, {"u": 29, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 8, "sent": 0, "present": [1]}, {"u": 30, "kind": "action", "text": "I shall be very much obliged if you will.", "para": 8, "sent": 1, "present": [1]}, {"u": 31, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 9, "sent": 0, "present": [1]}, {"u": 32, "kind": "action", "text": "It is very desirable that the public should be informed of it without delay.", "para": 9, "sent": 1, "present": [1]}, {"u": 33, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 10, "sent": 0, "present": [1]}, {"u": 34, "kind": "action", "text": "Certainly.", "para": 10, "sent": 1, "present": [1]}, {"u": 35, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann (coming back).", "para": 11, "sent": 0, "present": [1]}, {"u": 36, "kind": "action", "text": "She has just gone with it.", "para": 11, "sent": 1, "present": [1]}, {"u": 37, "kind": "action", "text": "Billing.", "para": 12, "sent": 0, "present": [1]}, {"u": 38, "kind": "action", "text": "Upon my soul, Doctor, you are going to be the foremost man in the town!", "para": 12, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 39, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann (walking about happily).", "para": 13, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 40, "kind": "action", "text": "Nonsense!", "para": 13, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 41, "kind": "action", "text": "As a matter of fact I have done nothing more than my duty.", "para": 13, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 42, "kind": "action", "text": "I have only made a lucky find\u2014that's all.", "para": 13, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 43, "kind": "action", "text": "Still, all the same...", "para": 13, "sent": 4, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 44, "kind": "action", "text": "Billing.", "para": 14, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 45, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad, don't you think the town ought to give Dr. Stockmann some sort of testimonial?", "para": 14, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 46, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 15, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 47, "kind": "action", "text": "I will suggest it, anyway.", "para": 15, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 48, "kind": "action", "text": "Billing.", "para": 16, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 49, "kind": "action", "text": "And I will speak to Aslaksen about it.", "para": 16, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 50, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 17, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 51, "kind": "action", "text": "No, my good friends, don't let us have any of that nonsense.", "para": 17, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 52, "kind": "action", "text": "I won't hear anything of the kind.", "para": 17, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 53, "kind": "action", "text": "And if the Baths Committee should think of voting me an increase of salary, I will not accept it.", "para": 17, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 54, "kind": "action", "text": "Do you hear, Katherine?\u2014I won't accept it.", "para": 17, "sent": 4, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 55, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 18, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 56, "kind": "action", "text": "You are quite right, Thomas.", "para": 18, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 57, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra (lifting her glass).", "para": 19, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 58, "kind": "action", "text": "Your health, father!", "para": 19, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 59, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad and Billing.", "para": 20, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 60, "kind": "action", "text": "Your health, Doctor!", "para": 20, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 61, "kind": "action", "text": "Good health!", "para": 20, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 62, "kind": "action", "text": "Horster (touches glasses with DR. STOCKMANN).", "para": 21, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 63, "kind": "action", "text": "I hope it will bring you nothing but good luck.", "para": 21, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 64, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 22, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 65, "kind": "action", "text": "Thank you, thank you, my dear fellows!", "para": 22, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 66, "kind": "action", "text": "I feel tremendously happy!", "para": 22, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 67, "kind": "action", "text": "It is a splendid thing for a man to be able to feel that he has done a service to his native town and to his fellow-citizens.", "para": 22, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 68, "kind": "action", "text": "Hurrah, Katherine!", "para": 22, "sent": 4, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 69, "kind": "action", "text": "(He puts his arms round her and whirls her round and round, while she protests with laughing cries.", "para": 22, "sent": 5, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 70, "kind": "action", "text": "They all laugh, clap their hands, and cheer the DOCTOR.", "para": 22, "sent": 6, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 71, "kind": "action", "text": "The boys put their heads in at the door to see what is going on.)", "para": 22, "sent": 7, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 72, "kind": "action", "text": "(SCENE.\u2014The same.", "para": 23, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 73, "kind": "action", "text": "The door into the dining room is shut.", "para": 23, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 74, "kind": "action", "text": "It is morning.", "para": 23, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 75, "kind": "action", "text": "MRS. STOCKMANN, with a sealed letter in her hand, comes in from the dining room, goes to the door of the DOCTOR'S study, and peeps in.)", "para": 23, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 76, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 24, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 77, "kind": "action", "text": "Are you in, Thomas?", "para": 24, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 78, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann (from within his room).", "para": 25, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 79, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, I have just come in.", "para": 25, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 80, "kind": "action", "text": "(Comes into the room.)", "para": 25, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 81, "kind": "action", "text": "What is it?", "para": 25, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 82, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 26, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 83, "kind": "action", "text": "A letter from your brother.", "para": 26, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 84, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 27, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 85, "kind": "action", "text": "Aha, let us see!", "para": 27, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 86, "kind": "action", "text": "(Opens the letter and reads:) \"I return herewith the manuscript you sent me\" (reads on in a low murmur) H'm!\u2014", "para": 27, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 87, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 28, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 88, "kind": "action", "text": "What does he say?", "para": 28, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 89, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann (putting the papers in his pocket).", "para": 29, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 90, "kind": "action", "text": "Oh, he only writes that he will come up here himself about midday.", "para": 29, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 91, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 30, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 92, "kind": "action", "text": "Well, try and remember to be at home this time.", "para": 30, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 93, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 31, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 94, "kind": "action", "text": "That will be all right; I have got through all my morning visits.", "para": 31, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 95, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 32, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 96, "kind": "action", "text": "I am extremely curious to know how he takes it.", "para": 32, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 97, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 33, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 98, "kind": "action", "text": "You will see he won't like it's having been I, and not he, that made the discovery.", "para": 33, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 99, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 34, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 100, "kind": "action", "text": "Aren't you a little nervous about that?", "para": 34, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 101, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 35, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 102, "kind": "action", "text": "Oh, he really will be pleased enough, you know.", "para": 35, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 103, "kind": "action", "text": "But, at the same time, Peter is so confoundedly afraid of anyone's doing any service to the town except himself.", "para": 35, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 104, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 36, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 105, "kind": "action", "text": "I will tell you what, Thomas\u2014you should be good natured, and share the credit of this with him.", "para": 36, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 106, "kind": "action", "text": "Couldn't you make out that it was he who set you on the scent of this discovery?", "para": 36, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 107, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 37, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 108, "kind": "action", "text": "I am quite willing.", "para": 37, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 109, "kind": "action", "text": "If only I can get the thing set right.", "para": 37, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 110, "kind": "action", "text": "I\u2014", "para": 37, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 111, "kind": "action", "text": "(MORTEN KIIL puts his head in through the door leading from the hall, looks around in an enquiring manner, and chuckles.)", "para": 38, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 112, "kind": "action", "text": "Morten Kiil (slyly).", "para": 39, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 113, "kind": "action", "text": "Is it\u2014is it true?", "para": 39, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 114, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann (going to the door).", "para": 40, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 115, "kind": "action", "text": "Father!\u2014is it you?", "para": 40, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 116, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 41, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 117, "kind": "action", "text": "Ah, Mr. Kiil\u2014good morning, good morning!", "para": 41, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 118, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 42, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 119, "kind": "action", "text": "But come along in.", "para": 42, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 120, "kind": "action", "text": "Morten Kiil.", "para": 43, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 121, "kind": "action", "text": "If it is true, I will; if not, I am off.", "para": 43, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 122, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 44, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 123, "kind": "action", "text": "If what is true?", "para": 44, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}]}